<!doctype html>
<html lang="<%= locale %>">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= t("about.title") %></title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="page-transition font-sans">
    <header class="brand-header">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-6 py-4">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">
          <img class="brand-logo" src="/assets/brand/logo-t.png" alt="BarnSight logo" />
          <span>BarnSight</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <%- include("partials/language-switcher") %>
          <a href="/faq" class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 hover:text-amber-900"><%= t("nav.faq") %></a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 hover:text-amber-900"><%= t("nav.pricing") %></a>
          <% if (currentUser) { %>
          <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-secondary"><%= t("nav.dashboard") %></a>
          <% } else { %>
          <a href="/register" class="btn-secondary"><%= t("nav.register") %></a>
          <a href="/login" class="btn-primary"><%= t("nav.login") %></a>
          <% } %>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-14 sm:py-18">
      <section class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-amber-800/20 bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-amber-900">
            <%= t("about.badge") %>
          </p>
          <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[0.92] tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-6xl">
            AI cleanliness monitoring for farms that need reliability, not friction.
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-700">
            BarnSight develops computer vision solutions for agricultural hygiene monitoring. The platform enables real-time detection and reporting of barn floor contamination so farmers and inspectors can maintain cleaner, safer facilities with clearer evidence.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-600">
            The system is designed around a practical operational loop: camera capture, edge inference, centralized ingestion, structured storage, and a dashboard for review. It supports human judgment with faster visibility, not replacement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel p-7">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950"><%= t("about.included") %></h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-700">
            <li>• Edge detection optimized for low-latency and offline-capable operation in farm environments.</li>
            <li>• Centralized ingestion for storing and querying detection events from distributed edge hardware.</li>
            <li>• Model training support for custom YOLO-based detectors adapted to different barn conditions.</li>
            <li>• Reviewable detections with timestamps, confidence scores, imagery, and audit trail.</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-20 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="panel p-7">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-950"><%= t("about.card1") %></h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-700"><%= t("about.card1Body") %></p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-600">Every detection remains visible and reviewable so teams can understand what happened, where it happened, and what should be done next.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel p-7">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-950"><%= t("about.card2") %></h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-700"><%= t("about.card2Body") %></p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-600">On-device inference reduces latency and supports harsh conditions where connectivity is intermittent and operational simplicity matters.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="panel p-7">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-zinc-950"><%= t("about.card3") %></h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-700"><%= t("about.card3Body") %></p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-600">From one barn to multi-site rollouts, BarnSight keeps the data model consistent across devices, zones, users, analytics, and reports.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-20 grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
        <article class="panel p-7">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500">Engineering principles</p>
          <div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] border border-amber-900/10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] border-b border-amber-900/10 bg-amber-50/70 px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950">
              <span>Principle</span>
              <span>Meaning</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-amber-900/10 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-700">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">Reliability first</span>
              <span>Systems must continue to operate under poor connectivity and uneven on-site conditions.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-amber-900/10 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-700">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">Performance matters</span>
              <span>Real-time inference with bounded resources and minimal latency on edge hardware.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-amber-900/10 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-700">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">Simplicity by default</span>
              <span>Interfaces should require no training to operate effectively for staff in the field.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-700">
              <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">Transparency</span>
              <span>Confidence scores, raw imagery, timestamps, and reviewable event history stay visible.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="panel p-7">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500">Projects</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-700">
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">barnsight-edge</p>
              <p>Embedded computer vision system for real-time excrement detection from camera feeds.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">barnsight-api</p>
              <p>Async FastAPI backend handling event ingestion, user management, analytics, and reporting.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">barnsight-train</p>
              <p>Training pipeline for custom YOLO detection models with dataset management and export.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-950">barnsight-web</p>
              <p>Node.js and Express web interface with public marketing pages and a secure operational dashboard.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/barnsight" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-amber-900">Visit GitHub</a>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-20 rounded-[2rem] border border-amber-900/10 bg-zinc-950 px-7 py-8 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-950/12">
        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-end">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/45">Contributing</p>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-8 text-white/72">
              BarnSight welcomes contributions from engineers, researchers, and agricultural professionals. The preferred workflow is straightforward: review current issues, propose a clear solution, and submit pull requests that are correct, readable, and aligned with the operational goals of the platform.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/72">
            <p>License: GPL-3.0 unless noted otherwise.</p>
            <a href="https://github.com/barnsight" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex transition hover:text-white">github.com/barnsight</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script src="/public/pageTransitions.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
